,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["肚子餓的時候正好經過，就來嚐個鮮吧！\n經典豚骨拉麵（含服務費231元）來一碗，一般水準、中規中矩的豚骨拉麵湯頭和配料，不驚艷也不扣分。\n其他評論嫌麵條太硬，我個人倒是很喜歡，這種硬度和日本口味比較接近。\n\n「服務」就是餐點上桌，僅只於此。\n\n店內總共12個座位，都是吧台位。\n桌面很乾淨，涼水和餐巾紙在桌面。\n餐具隨餐附上。\n\n可以累積東森點數，但不知道為什麼我的手機號碼沒有成功。\n可以刷卡，發票可以存手機載具。\n\n捷運臺北車站往K區前進，地面有貼紅色指示箭頭。",null,[0,101]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1488570718288863440/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBhTldSVlVuRlVNakZKVld4cmVtRlViRkpTU0VveVdURmFOV1JIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,13587,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paNWRVUnFUMjFJVWxremFUbFJSSEoyWTFaNWRHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x525057c19d6fb4e6!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjZ5dURqT21IUlkzaTlRRHJ2Y1Z5dGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paNWRVUnFUMjFJVWxremFUbFJSSEoyWTFaNWRHYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paNWRVUnFUMjFJVWxremFUbFJSSEoyWTFaNWRHYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paNWRVUn